Well, what do we have here, hmm?

1184
02:03:03,836 --> 02:03:07,464
這兒漂亮嗎  漂亮嗎
Isn't this pretty? It's pretty.

1185
02:03:09,925 --> 02:03:12,969
- 你這個小人  - 你告訴我想脫離目前的困境
- You slimy piece of shit. - You told me you wanted out from under.

1186
02:03:13,137 --> 02:03:16,306
你想脫身嗎  這是出路
You're scared to death, right? You want out? This is out, Charlene.

1187
02:03:16,474 --> 02:03:20,143
- 你得到什麼好處啦  - 我沒好處  你這個蠢娘們
- Yeah, what's your end? - I... You stupid broad.

1188
02:03:20,311 --> 02:03:22,771
- 我怎麼會牽涉此事的  - 嘿  冷靜  別衝動
- How'd I get into this? - Hey, hey, hey. Easy.

1189
02:03:22,938 --> 02:03:24,147
你聽到我說的了
You heard me.

1190
02:03:24,315 --> 02:03:27,358
她已經夠難受的了  你為何不給她倒杯酒呢
She had a rough ride. Why don't you fix her a drink or something?

1191
02:03:27,526 --> 02:03:30,528
- 到櫥櫃看看  - 去她的
- Look in the cabinet above the sink. - Fuck her.

1192
02:03:32,948 --> 02:03:36,076
- 你最好進去  不要出來  - 好吧
- You'd better get in there and stay in there. - All right, all right.

1193
02:03:38,829 --> 02:03:41,081
看看這兒
Well, lookie here.

1194
02:03:42,249 --> 02:03:44,542
我是澤加  洛城警局  兇殺組探員
My name is Sergeant Drucker, L.A.P.D. Homicide.

1195
02:03:44,710 --> 02:03:48,713
- 要送多明進睡房嗎  - 他和我待在一起
- You wanna put Dominick in the bedroom? - He stays with me.

1196
02:03:49,215 --> 02:03:51,132
坐下
There we go.

1197
02:03:58,724 --> 02:04:00,683
現在怎麼辦
So, what now?

1198
02:04:02,937 --> 02:04:06,689
他說得對  你想脫身  這是出路
Well, he's right, because you want out, this is out.

1199
02:04:08,109 --> 02:04:11,986
- 你真的要出賣基斯嗎  - 正是
- You believe you have to betray Chris. - No shit.

1200
02:04:12,154 --> 02:04:15,115
這就對了  你是得這樣做
That's right. You would have to.

1201
02:04:15,282 --> 02:04:19,536
若不出賣基斯  多明會是受害人
See, if you don't betray Chris, you victimize Dominick.

1202
02:04:20,037 --> 02:04:23,248
因為當你入獄時  他便會成為孤兒
Because he becomes an orphan when you go to prison as an accessory...

1203
02:04:23,415 --> 02:04:25,875
你也沒有父母來照顧他
...because you got no living parents to take him.

1204
02:04:26,043 --> 02:04:30,421
他會被送進收養所  青少年中心
So he ends up state-raised in foster homes, juvenile facilities.

1205
02:04:30,589 --> 02:04:32,841
之後他會偷車
Then he steals a car.

1206
02:04:33,092 --> 02:04:38,263
然後入獄學會做真正的罪犯
Then he winds up in gladiator academies like Chino and Tracy.

1207
02:04:38,430 --> 02:04:41,724
毀了一生
Fucked for life.

1208
02:04:41,892 --> 02:04:45,228
你是過來人  知道會有何下場
You know what happens, because you've been there.

1209
02:04:46,397 --> 02:04:51,568
多明沒機會選擇生活  但基斯有
Dominick didn't get a chance yet to choose his life, but Chris did.

1210
02:04:52,653 --> 02:04:56,239
你若供出基斯  你會沒有案底
If you give up Chris, you get off clean.

1211
02:04:56,407 --> 02:05:00,326
你可以為了孩子而這樣做  你可以撫養他
You can do it for your kid, so you can raise him.

1212
02:05:04,498 --> 02:05:07,876
- 你還有什麼條件  - 各種各樣的東西
- What else are you selling? - All kinds of shit.

1213
02:05:08,752 --> 02:05:13,965
但我不用說服你  因為我是對的
But I don't have to sell this and you know it, because this kind of shit here sells itself.

1214
02:05:20,264 --> 02:05:22,265
最新消息
Okay, Danny, here's an update.

1215
02:05:22,433 --> 02:05:25,768
- 澤加在二線  - 等一等
- Drucker's on Line 2. - Lieutenant, hold on for a second.

1216
02:05:27,938 --> 02:05:30,064
澤加在另一電話線
Lieutenant, I have Drucker on the other line.

1217
02:05:30,232 --> 02:05:31,608
三人通話吧
Oh, well, conference him in.

1218
02:05:33,110 --> 02:05:36,821
- 說吧  - 雲信  是我
- Go ahead. - Vincent, it's me.

1219
02:05:38,741 --> 02:05:41,367
你的答覆是怎樣的
I want an answer. What's it gonna be?

1220
02:05:47,958 --> 02:05:50,460
我們準備好了  她會打電話
We're set here. She'll make the call.

1221
02:05:50,628 --> 02:05:53,796
好的  情況是這樣
Okay, that's good. Here's the deal here.

1222
02:05:53,964 --> 02:05:59,802
許·班尼已改過自新  成為洗心革面的好市民
Hugh Benny has reformed his wayward life and become a born-again good citizen.

1223
02:05:59,970 --> 02:06:04,515
叫榮谷的人向我們出賣了尼爾
Apparently, Neil got sold out to us by this cowboy named Waingro.

1224
02:06:04,683 --> 02:06:07,435
榮谷曾是他手下
Waingro used to be a part of Neil's crew...

1225
02:06:07,603 --> 02:06:11,189
後替洗錢人工作  他叫宏山
...then he went to work for a money launderer named Van Zant.

1226
02:06:11,357 --> 02:06:17,153
現時正派人前住宏山家中  因為他今晚較早前被殺
Units are at Van Zant's house as we speak because he got shot dead earlier tonight.

1227
02:06:17,488 --> 02:06:20,823
尼爾要對付的人會是榮谷
Now, if Neil goes after anybody else, it's gonna be Waingro.

1228
02:06:20,991 --> 02:06:24,327
榮谷正入住侯爵機場酒店套房
Waingro just got himself a suite at the airport Marquis...

1229
02:06:24,495 --> 02:06:27,872
並化名詹美臣  他正在那兒
...under the name "Jameson". He's there now.

1230
02:06:28,040 --> 02:06:31,125
我要你把這消息告訴外圍帶家
I want you to get that to bail bondsmen, bookies...

1231
02:06:31,293 --> 02:06:34,504
奉派警員及線人
...assignment officers and snitches in County.

1232
02:06:34,672 --> 02:06:37,048
任何能把消息外洩的人
Anyone you can think of who'll put it on the street.

1233
02:06:37,216 --> 02:06:41,386
派人到酒店駐守  並每隔半小時收聽無線電
Deploy a team at the hotel and personally check their come every 30 minutes.

1234
02:06:41,553 --> 02:06:45,640
也許尼爾會殺他  明白嗎  你感覺怎麼樣
Because maybe Neil will go for him. Okay? How you feeling?

1235
02:06:46,350 --> 02:06:49,602
- 不算太慘  我會活著  - 很好
- Banged up, but I'll live. - Okay.

1236
02:06:56,986 --> 02:06:58,861
他仍在
He's here.

1237
02:06:59,154 --> 02:07:01,364
尼爾還沒走
Neil is still here.

1238
02:07:01,907 --> 02:07:03,866
我能感覺到
I can feel it.

1239
02:07:04,118 --> 02:07:06,661
會留多久
But for how long?

1240
02:07:07,246 --> 02:07:10,164
最多七八個小時
Seven, eight hours, max.

1241
02:07:18,549 --> 02:07:19,882
你做過什麼
What did you do?

1242
02:07:20,592 --> 02:07:24,304
- 是你做的嗎  - 我不是賣金屬的
- That was you? - It's what I don't do, I don't sell metal.

1243
02:07:24,471 --> 02:07:27,390
計劃原本順利  但現在出了麻煩
Would have been okay, you fly out after. Now it's jammed.

1244
02:07:27,558 --> 02:07:31,561
- 我們要一起走  - 那些人和你一起的嗎
- Now we gotta go together. - Those other people were with you?

1245
02:07:33,689 --> 02:07:35,815
我的朋友米高
My friend, Michael...

1246
02:07:36,900 --> 02:07:39,527
他知道所冒的險
...he knew the risks. He didn't have to be there.

1247
02:07:43,532 --> 02:07:46,159
身處險境便要冒生命危險
It rains, you get wet.

1248
02:07:48,203 --> 02:07:49,412
收拾東西
Get packed and let's go.

1249
02:07:56,587 --> 02:07:59,255
伊荻
Eady.

1250
02:08:09,016 --> 02:08:12,268
你為何這樣對我
Why did you do this to me?

1251
02:08:17,775 --> 02:08:19,817
你究竟是誰
Who are you?

1252
02:08:22,654 --> 02:08:25,782
不會有事的  明白嗎
It's gonna be all right. You understand? It'll be all right.

1253
02:08:30,662 --> 02:08:32,789
不會有事的
It's gonna be all right.

1254
02:08:33,791 --> 02:08:35,416
不會的
Right.

1255
02:08:44,009 --> 02:08:47,637
這個地址  D層十八單位  有一輛汽車
There's this Camaro at this address, Level D, Slot 18.

1256
02:08:52,351 --> 02:08:54,394
這兒有現金
Here's some cash.

1257
02:08:56,980 --> 02:08:58,147
此事何時瞭解
When's it over?

1258
02:09:01,652 --> 02:09:03,194
二十二小時後
22 hours from now.

1259
02:09:03,654 --> 02:09:07,365
- 那時我們便可脫身  - 那時你會讓我離開嗎
- Then we get out of here clean. - When will you let me leave?

1260
02:09:11,286 --> 02:09:14,163
那現在就走吧  你想離開嗎  門在那邊
Go now. You want out? There's the door.

1261
02:09:14,832 --> 02:09:16,999
你稍後會讓我離開嗎
Will you let me leave later?

1262
02:09:22,089 --> 02:09:24,298
情況會不同
It will be different.

1263
02:09:25,342 --> 02:09:27,510
你還不明白嗎
Do you understand?

1264
02:09:58,000 --> 02:09:59,542
準備好了
It's ready.

1265
02:09:59,710 --> 02:10:01,544
雲信
Vincent.

1266
02:10:06,967 --> 02:10:09,135
這是我的朋友洛夫
This is my friend Ralph.

1267
02:10:09,303 --> 02:10:11,262
你沒說你已已經
You didn't tell me you were...

1268
02:10:12,347 --> 02:10:15,224
- 天啊  - 羅蘭在哪兒
- Oh, my God. - Where's Lauren?

1269
02:10:15,392 --> 02:10:18,603
- 她在碧芙家中  - 聽著  此事和我無關
- She's at Lisa-Beth's. - Look, this has nothing to do with me.

1270
02:10:18,770 --> 02:10:22,690
- 我不知道  對不起  - 對不起什麼  坐下
- I didn't know. I'm terribly sorry. - What are you sorry about? Sit down.

1271
02:10:23,358 --> 02:10:25,401
你不生氣嗎
Don't you even get angry?

1272
02:10:25,569 --> 02:10:28,070
我當然生氣
I'm angry, yeah.

1273
02:10:28,238 --> 02:10:30,656
我非常生氣  洛夫
I'm very angry, Ralph.

1274
02:10:30,824 --> 02:10:33,910
若她想要你干她  你可以干我太太
You know, you can ball my wife if she wants you to.

1275
02:10:35,496 --> 02:10:38,581
你可以躺在她的沙發上
You can lounge around here on her sofa.

1276
02:10:39,917 --> 02:10:42,210
在她前夫的
In her ex-husband's...

1277
02:10:42,377 --> 02:10:47,423
高科技後現代主義的荒謬家中  若你想的話
...dead-tech, post-modernistic, bullshit house, if you want to...

1278
02:10:49,259 --> 02:10:55,598
但你不能看我該死的電視機
...but you do not get to watch my fucking television set!

1279
02:10:55,766 --> 02:10:57,266
天啊
For God's sake.

1280
02:11:03,815 --> 02:11:05,608
把電視機放下
Put the television set down.

1281
02:11:05,776 --> 02:11:08,319
- 我沒對你不忠  賤貨  - 也許你應該
- I never cheated on you, bitch. - Maybe you should have.

1282
02:11:08,487 --> 02:11:10,780
- 我應該嗎  - 你對此也有責任
- I should have? - In a way, you're a party to this.

1283
02:11:10,948 --> 02:11:13,991
沒錯  我要洛夫干你  因為這使我開心
Oh, yeah. I made Ralph fuck you because it makes me feel good.

1284
02:11:14,159 --> 02:11:15,326
我們的處境荒謬
Our situation is absurd.

1285
02:11:17,037 --> 02:11:21,874
- 聽著  也許我該走了  - 住口  洛夫  坐下
- Look, maybe I should... - Shut up, Ralph. Sit down!

1286
02:11:23,961 --> 02:11:27,880
我為何要向你把事情解釋清楚  你又做什麼了
Why is it that I have to figure things out and explain them to you? What do you do?

1287
02:11:28,048 --> 02:11:31,884
- 我說話算話  亦言出必行  - 哼  多麼可敬
- I say what I mean, and I do what I say. - Mm, how admirable.

1288
02:11:32,052 --> 02:11:34,136
- 那當然  - 可是沒什麼是和我們有關的
- You bet. - Except none of it's about us.

1289
02:11:34,972 --> 02:11:36,013
是的
No.

1290
02:11:37,474 --> 02:11:41,060
我一定是抽大麻或服興奮劑迷糊了
I may be stoned on grass and Prozac...

1291
02:11:41,228 --> 02:11:43,854
但你在我們的生活中猶如死了
...but you've been walking through our life dead.

1292
02:11:44,022 --> 02:11:48,693
我不得不作踐自己  找洛夫來終斷我們的關係
Now I have to demean myself with Ralph just to get closure with you.

1293
02:12:01,248 --> 02:12:03,499
護照  旅行支票  信用卡
Passports, traveler's checks, plastic.

1294
02:12:04,167 --> 02:12:09,005
這飛機  在洛城機場包機站十七號機庫
The plane, charter terminal, LAX, Hangar 17.

1295
02:12:09,172 --> 02:12:10,923
確定密碼是一零一一山嶺
Call letters are 1011 Sierra.

1296
02:12:14,303 --> 02:12:18,014
飛機會降落  等你五分鐘  然後便起飛
Touches down, holds for you five minutes, then splits.

1297
02:12:18,181 --> 02:12:21,684
飛機會通過航空局檢查等手續
The plane will stand an FAA check. Filed a flight plan, the works.

1298
02:12:23,687 --> 02:12:26,022
- 基斯呢  - 他走了
- Hey, where's Chris? - He's gone.

1299
02:12:27,482 --> 02:12:28,524
什麼
What?

1300
02:12:29,151 --> 02:12:31,694
他說去找莎蓮  他走了
Said he's going on his own. Went to look for Charlene.

1301
02:12:31,862 --> 02:12:34,697
- 是你帶他來這兒的嗎  - 是的  我帶他來了
- Didn't you bring him here? - Yeah, I brought him here.

1302
02:12:35,157 --> 02:12:36,991
怎麼回事
What happened?

1303
02:12:37,159 --> 02:12:39,535
這是個自由國家
It's a free country, brother.

1304
02:12:43,957 --> 02:12:48,377
晚上九時聯絡我  確保一切妥當
Check in with me at 9. Everything's still cool.

1305
02:12:49,713 --> 02:12:51,380
好的
All right.

1306
02:13:13,945 --> 02:13:16,906
我甚至不知道自己在做什麼
I don't even know what I'm doing anymore.

1307
02:13:19,785 --> 02:13:21,994
我知道人生苦短
I know life is short.

1308
02:13:22,245 --> 02:13:24,872
能活多久是運氣
Whatever time you get is luck.

1309
02:13:27,084 --> 02:13:29,168
你想終斷這段關係
You wanna walk?

1310
02:13:31,421 --> 02:13:33,714
你現在就能離開
You walk right now.

1311
02:13:34,800 --> 02:13:36,926
或者你自願
Or on your own...

1312
02:13:37,094 --> 02:13:40,137
你自願選擇跟我一起走
On your own, you choose to come with me.

1313
02:13:46,228 --> 02:13:48,270
我只知道
All I know is...

1314
02:13:50,065 --> 02:13:54,402
我無論到任何地方去  都將失去意義
All I know is there's no point in me going anywhere anymore...

1315
02:13:54,945 --> 02:13:57,029
因為只有我獨自一人
...if it's gonna be alone...

1316
02:13:57,948 --> 02:13:59,740
沒有你陪在身邊
...without you.

1317
02:14:06,581 --> 02:14:08,165
伊荻
Eady.

1318
02:14:57,883 --> 02:15:00,342
- 喂  - 雲信  我抓了個活的
- Yeah. - Yeah, Vincent, I got a live one.

1319
02:15:01,052 --> 02:15:02,678
好  我等著
